{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rBHOIY8idY1795144246.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>現貨金再跌逾百分之2，下試3,500美元水平，幾日內下跌逾300美元。分析相信，美國聯儲局下月大幅加息機會不大，金價或在現水平有支持。</p><p></p><p>獨立外匯及商品分析師盧楚仁表示：「聯儲局是否能加息0.5厘，我相信第一，沒這迫切性，也沒這需要；第二是以股市目前勢頭，發錢進去也這麼弱，作為聯儲局，難道每天看著股市下跌？現時迫近3,500美元，有個頗大支持位，看會否在3,500美元有承托力，作出一定反彈。若反彈、不用太多，由3,500美元反彈至4,000美元，反彈500美元。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:23:54.891883+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T03:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:17:35.987892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T04:17:17.446797+00:00","content_hash":"a249d13c689b8acda1c43c70edd730994d935be20b5737ddb847382d65f2a5f9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:23:54.891883+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}